---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Legal notice — AVARA by BLUVA"
  description="Legal information for the AVARA by BLUVA website."
>
  <header class="legal-header">
    <div class="legal-container legal-nav">
      <a href="/en/" class="legal-logo" aria-label="AVARA by BLUVA">
        <img src="/images/logo-avara.png" alt="AVARA by BLUVA" />
      </a>
      <a href="/en/" class="legal-back">← Back to the website</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="legal-main">
    <div class="legal-container">
      <div class="legal-heading">
        <p class="legal-eyebrow">Legal information</p>
        <h1>Legal notice</h1>
        <p class="legal-date">Last updated: 24 November 2026</p>
        <p class="legal-notice">
          This English version is provided for information purposes.
          In the event of a discrepancy, the French version should be consulted.
        </p>
      </div>

      <article class="legal-content">
        <section>
          <h2>1. Website publisher</h2>
          <p>
            The website <strong>avarastudio.be</strong> presents the services
            offered under the trading name <strong>AVARA by BLUVA</strong>.
          </p>
          <div class="legal-details">
            <p><strong>Business:</strong><br />Dijoux, Jacques</p>
            <p><strong>Trading name:</strong><br />AVARA by BLUVA</p>
            <p><strong>Business form:</strong><br />Sole proprietorship</p>
            <p><strong>Belgian company number:</strong><br />1045.197.566</p>
            <p><strong>VAT number:</strong><br />BE 1045.197.566</p>
            <p>
              <strong>Address:</strong><br />
              Sentier des Morlères 5<br />
              6280 Loverval<br />
              Belgium
            </p>
            <p><strong>Website manager:</strong><br />Thomas Dijoux</p>
            <p>
              <strong>Email:</strong><br />
              <a href="mailto:contact@avarastudio.be">contact@avarastudio.be</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>2. Purpose of the website</h2>
          <p>
            The website presents the activities of AVARA by BLUVA, including
            website creation and redesign, e-commerce projects, improvements
            to existing websites and the development of custom business
            automation solutions.
          </p>
          <p>
            Information and examples published on the website are provided for
            informational and commercial purposes. The scope, price and terms
            of a service are confirmed individually before a project begins.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>3. Hosting</h2>
          <p>
            The website is hosted by <strong>Netlify, Inc.</strong>, which
            provides the technical infrastructure used to host and deliver
            the website.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>4. Intellectual property</h2>
          <p>
            Unless otherwise stated, the text, graphic elements, concepts,
            mock-ups, logos and other content on this website are protected
            by the applicable intellectual property rules.
          </p>
          <p>
            Substantial reproduction, adaptation, distribution or use without
            prior authorisation is prohibited except where permitted by law.
          </p>
          <p>
            Projects displayed in the portfolio may include demonstration
            concepts designed to illustrate AVARA by BLUVA's capabilities.
            They are not presented as client work when this is not the case.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>5. Liability</h2>
          <p>
            AVARA by BLUVA makes reasonable efforts to keep information on the
            website accurate and up to date. Some information may nevertheless
            change over time.
          </p>
          <p>
            Use of the website and its information does not replace the precise
            contractual definition of a service.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>6. External links</h2>
          <p>
            The website may contain links to third-party websites or services.
            AVARA by BLUVA does not continuously control their content or
            practices and cannot be held responsible for them.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>7. Personal data</h2>
          <p>
            Information about personal data processing, including data
            submitted through the website forms, is explained in our
            <a href="/en/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>8. Contact</h2>
          <p>
            For questions about this website or the services offered by
            AVARA by BLUVA, contact
            <a href="mailto:contact@avarastudio.be">contact@avarastudio.be</a>.
          </p>
        </section>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="legal-footer">
    <div class="legal-container legal-footer-inner">
      <div><strong>AVARA</strong><span>by BLUVA</span></div>
      <div class="legal-footer-links">
        <a href="/en/">Home</a>
        <a href="/en/privacy/">Privacy</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Layout>


<style>
  .legal-container {
    width: min(calc(100% - 40px), 920px);
    margin-inline: auto;
  }
  .legal-header {
    padding: 22px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(23, 23, 23, 0.08);
    background: #f7f7f4;
  }
  .legal-nav {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 30px;
  }
  .legal-logo img {
    display: block;
    width: 145px;
    height: auto;
  }
  .legal-back {
    color: #686868;
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .legal-main {
    padding: 100px 0 120px;
    background: #f7f7f4;
  }
  .legal-heading {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin-bottom: 65px;
  }
  .legal-eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    color: #6d5dfc;
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }
  .legal-heading h1 {
    font-family: "Manrope", sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 7vw, 5.2rem);
    line-height: 0.98;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
  }
  .legal-date {
    margin-top: 22px;
    color: #686868;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  .legal-notice {
    margin-top: 18px;
    padding: 15px 18px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: #efefe9;
    color: #686868;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .legal-content {
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(23, 23, 23, 0.08);
    border-radius: 30px;
    background: white;
  }
  .legal-content section {
    padding: 40px 44px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(23, 23, 23, 0.08);
  }
  .legal-content section:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }
  .legal-content h2 {
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    font-family: "Manrope", sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  }
  .legal-content p {
    margin-top: 12px;
    color: #686868;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }
  .legal-content ul {
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 18px 0 20px 20px;
    color: #686868;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .legal-content strong {
    color: #171717;
  }
  .legal-content a {
    color: #6d5dfc;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  .legal-details {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 12px 40px;
    margin-top: 25px;
  }
  .legal-details p {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 18px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(23, 23, 23, 0.07);
  }
  .legal-footer {
    padding: 32px 0;
    background: #171717;
    color: white;
  }
  .legal-footer-inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 30px;
  }
  .legal-footer-inner > div:first-child {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .legal-footer-inner strong {
    font-family: "Manrope", sans-serif;
  }
  .legal-footer-inner span {
    color: #aaa1ff;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }
  .legal-footer-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 22px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 650px) {
    .legal-main {
      padding: 70px 0 90px;
    }
    .legal-content section {
      padding: 30px 24px;
    }
    .legal-details {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .legal-footer-inner {
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
